      "text": "Less than 24 hours before HAWTHORNE HEIGHTS LONELY WORLD TOUR happens at the Skydome, SM North EDSA! 🤘\n\nThe sing-alongs will be LOUD, and the memories will come flooding back. 🔊\n\nSecure your tickets now at all @smtickets outlets nationwide or online through https://t.co/45baRN0gAy, and make new memories alongside fans, friends and family. Oh, and scream your hearts out! 🖤🙌\n\nIf you haven’t secured your official @HawthorneHgts shirt, you can still buy it walk-in tomorrow at the venue! 👕🔥\nLimited pieces are left, so make sure to hurry once you’re there and drop by our merch booth!\n\n#HAWTHORNEHEIGHTS2026\n#HAWTHORNEHEIGHTS2026INMANILA",
